        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"83ae55ab-f38c-4a0c-b85a-88545a6f1292\",\"review_text\":\"♡\"},{\"review_id\":\"0ca67f4d-af81-4d04-bb59-7705d7843dc5\",\"review_text\":\"Gd\"},{\"review_id\":\"03c07c4a-7720-4d45-bcd4-07d8a7bf0875\",\"review_text\":\"I am in my absolute glory using this app. I play it morning, noon and night. It lulls me to sleep. There is such a variety of music it is almost mind boggling. It is worth every penny. Bravo Spotify.\"},{\"review_id\":\"f761042d-9315-46db-96c7-a0339e864c07\",\"review_text\":\"good app\"},{\"review_id\":\"7312d5d7-c9a2-41ab-a7fc-d192368acabe\",\"review_text\":\"I hate this app cause I thought premium only for no add so I was unlikeing all song and I want to search back to like so when this song finished the other one will play so I was searching and when I click the song the song name is the same but the song different and then I just now we need premium to hear song freely\"},{\"review_id\":\"95394a58-ff95-4a34-ac99-172eca098bd7\",\"review_text\":\"Perfect app 👍👍👍👍\"},{\"review_id\":\"07ffedb9-fb03-440e-9d9f-cd4b124dfc56\",\"review_text\":\"live laugh loved\"},{\"review_id\":\"e1b9d3be-805a-44da-9fe7-0f4aba38bb22\",\"review_text\":\"I boycoot\"},{\"review_id\":\"13aaca55-cd33-4b4c-8c95-7f2dd9b03062\",\"review_text\":\"Hate this application Pakistani people do fast this is Sweden application\"},{\"review_id\":\"cf25551b-33b7-4282-9514-e313a21e0514\",\"review_text\":\"Its just an amazing music application where allows me to discover new either recalls an old memories that I aim to retain.\"}]}"
